      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a great start, really captures that sense of \"burden of responsibility.\" \n\ncan you actually write out the monologue now? i want to see how he phrases the part about why voting is basically obsolete. like, how does he explain that letting people vote is actually a threat to survival? make it sound really intellectual and logical, like he's explaining a mathematical necessity rather than just wanting power.",
